</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-81053f718b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-06-06T18:12:28Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h3>&lt;a id=\&#34;privacy\&#34;>&lt;/a>Privacy Notice&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Your privacy is a priority for PG&amp;amp;E, and we take efforts to protect the information we hold about you. This Privacy Policy addresses information obtained from California consumers, PG&amp;amp;E customers, website visitors and mobile application users and explains how we treat personal information that we collect and use about you.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>This policy applies by default to our interactions with California residents.&amp;nbsp; However, if you are presented with a different PG&amp;amp;E privacy notice while interacting with us, it will apply.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>This Privacy Policy covers Pacific Gas and Electric Company and its parent company, PG&amp;amp;E Corporation, and also covers any other site or service that links to this Privacy Policy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Customers with disabilities can access this Privacy Policy through &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/customer-service.html\&#34;>Assistive Resources&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;or by calling &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18776606789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Get additional information about:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/privacy-center/notice-of-accessing-collecting-storing-using-and-disclosing-energy-usage-information.html\&#34;>The privacy of your PG&amp;amp;E energy usage data&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/privacy-center/employee-privacy-notice.html\&#34;>Your privacy rights as a PG&amp;amp;E employee, job applicant or contractor&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h3>&lt;a id=\&#34;definitions\&#34;>&lt;/a>Definitions&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Personal information:&lt;/b> Identifies, relates to, describes, is reasonably capable of being associated with, or could reasonably be linked, directly or indirectly, with a particular consumer or household. It does not include:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Publicly available information&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>De-identified or aggregated information&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Information covered by certain federal and state laws.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>You:&lt;/b> Any California consumer, PG&amp;amp;E customer, website visitor or mobile application user.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-81053f718b" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="privacy"></a>Privacy Notice</h3>
<p> </p>
<p>Your privacy is a priority for PG&amp;E, and we take efforts to protect the information we hold about you. This Privacy Policy addresses information obtained from California consumers, PG&amp;E customers, website visitors and mobile application users and explains how we treat personal information that we collect and use about you.<br />
</p>
<p> </p>
<ul><li>This policy applies by default to our interactions with California residents.  However, if you are presented with a different PG&amp;E privacy notice while interacting with us, it will apply.</li><li>This Privacy Policy covers Pacific Gas and Electric Company and its parent company, PG&amp;E Corporation, and also covers any other site or service that links to this Privacy Policy. </li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p>Customers with disabilities can access this Privacy Policy through <a href="/en/account/customer-service.html">Assistive Resources</a> or by calling <a href="tel:18776606789">1-877-660-6789</a>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>Get additional information about:</p>
<ul><li><a href="/en/privacy-center/notice-of-accessing-collecting-storing-using-and-disclosing-energy-usage-information.html">The privacy of your PG&amp;E energy usage data</a></li><li><a href="/en/privacy-center/employee-privacy-notice.html">Your privacy rights as a PG&amp;E employee, job applicant or contractor</a></li></ul>
<p> </p>
<h3><a id="definitions"></a>Definitions</h3>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Personal information:</b> Identifies, relates to, describes, is reasonably capable of being associated with, or could reasonably be linked, directly or indirectly, with a particular consumer or household. It does not include:</p>
<ul><li>Publicly available information</li><li>De-identified or aggregated information</li><li>Information covered by certain federal and state laws.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p><b>You:</b> Any California consumer, PG&amp;E customer, website visitor or mobile application user.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f5614d0e5d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-05-09T23:44:25Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h3>&lt;a id=\&#34;howwecollect\&#34;>&lt;/a>How we collect your personal information&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>We may have collected personal information about you from a variety of sources in the past 12 months:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>From you:&lt;/b>&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>When you set up your account. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>For billing and payment, or when you start, receive or discontinue services or products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>When determining eligibility and your participation in utility programs.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>When you interact with PG&amp;amp;E or its representatives, including when you visit our facilities.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>By phone with a customer service representative or by mail, text or email. Also, through pge.com or our mobile apps.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>From our utility meters and other equipment&lt;/b>: When you use electricity and gas, energy usage data is collected by our metering systems. For some applications, such as rate analysis, we link usage data with your personal information.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>From providers&lt;/b>: We work with and receive personal information from third parties such as:&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Service providers, vendors, contractors and credit agencies&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Market researchers who provide utility products and services on our behalf&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>From your use of our website or mobile apps:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;We collect information about your visits and use of our website and mobile apps, including information through cookies and other logging technologies.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>From other sources&lt;/b>: We may supplement the information above with information we obtain from other sources. Those include Community Choice Aggregators and state and local government agencies.&lt;a id=\&#34;whatwecollect\&#34;>&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f5614d0e5d" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="howwecollect"></a>How we collect your personal information</h3>
<p> </p>
<p>We may have collected personal information about you from a variety of sources in the past 12 months:</p>
<p> </p>
<ul><li><b>From you:</b><ul><li>When you set up your account.  </li><li>For billing and payment, or when you start, receive or discontinue services or products. </li><li>When determining eligibility and your participation in utility programs.</li><li>When you interact with PG&amp;E or its representatives, including when you visit our facilities.</li><li>By phone with a customer service representative or by mail, text or email. Also, through pge.com or our mobile apps.<br />
<br />
</li></ul>
</li><li><b>From our utility meters and other equipment</b>: When you use electricity and gas, energy usage data is collected by our metering systems. For some applications, such as rate analysis, we link usage data with your personal information.<br />
<br />
</li><li><b>From providers</b>: We work with and receive personal information from third parties such as:<ul><li>Service providers, vendors, contractors and credit agencies</li><li>Market researchers who provide utility products and services on our behalf<br />
<br />
</li></ul>
</li><li><b>From your use of our website or mobile apps:</b> We collect information about your visits and use of our website and mobile apps, including information through cookies and other logging technologies.<br />
<br />
</li><li><b>From other sources</b>: We may supplement the information above with information we obtain from other sources. Those include Community Choice Aggregators and state and local government agencies.<a id="whatwecollect"></a></li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="table table--blue-color-scheme aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div>
    
    <div class="table-data  " data-table='{&#34;titleFormat&#34;:&#34;h6&#34;,&#34;subtitle&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003eThe chart below shows the categories of personal information we collect, how we use it, and to whom it is disclosed.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n&#34;,&#34;tableVariation&#34;:&#34;standard&#34;,&#34;sourceOfData&#34;:&#34;dialog&#34;,&#34;source&#34;:&#34;dialog&#34;,&#34;columnDetails&#34;:[{&#34;columnOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;columnName&#34;:&#34;Categories of personal information we collect&#34;,&#34;rowDetails&#34;:[{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eIdentifiers\u003c/b\u003e, such as your name, social security number, passport number, driver\u0027s license or government ID number, postal address, email address, account username, IP address, phone number, or other similar unique identifiers.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eInformation Subject to Protection Under California Law\u003c/b\u003e, such as the Identifiers above, your signature, and we or our service providers may collect your bank account number, credit card number, or debit card number.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eProtected Classification Characteristics\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;such as your racial or ethnic origin.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSensitive Personal Information\u003c/b\u003e, such as your Social Security number, driver\u0027s license or government-issued identification number, racial or ethnic origin or specific geolocation. \u0026nbsp;We only use this information as permitted by applicable law.\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003ePayment Information\u003c/b\u003e. We or our service providers may collect your bank account, credit card or debit card information.\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eCommercial Information\u003c/b\u003e, such as record of personal property, products or services obtained or considered, or other information related to purchasing or consumer histories.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eNon-Precise Geolocation Data\u003c/b\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eAudio, Electronic, Visual, Thermal, Olfactory or Similar Information.\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;Such as photos of visitors to PG\u0026amp;E facilities when they check-in, security camera footage, call recordings (e.g., customer service calls), and video captured by dash or external cameras installed on company vehicles, which may record the surrounding environment.\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eProfessional Information\u003c/b\u003e, including information relating to your role as a representative or agent of a company or business, such as your work title and contact information.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eInternet and Other Electronic Activity Information\u003c/b\u003e,\u0026nbsp;such as your browsing history, search history, information about your interactions with our website, use of our mobile apps, or interactions with our digital advertisements. This could include log data, device identifiers, and IP addresses. For more information, see our section on Cookies below.\u003c/p\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}}]},{&#34;columnOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;columnName&#34;:&#34;How we use the category of personal information&#34;,&#34;rowDetails&#34;:[{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProvide you with our services\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eMaintain your account\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOperate our business\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOtherwise communicate with you\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProvide you with our services\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eMaintain your account\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOtherwise communicate with you\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOnly as permitted by applicable law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003ePerforming services or providing goods reasonably expected by an average consumer\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eDetecting security incidents\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eResisting malicious, deceptive, or illegal actions\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eEnsuring the physical safety of individuals\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFor short-term, transient use, including non-personalized advertising\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003ePerforming or providing internal business services\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eVerifying or maintaining the quality or safety of a service or device\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFor purposes that do not infer characteristics about you\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProcess payments for our services\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eBetter understand your use of our services\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eInternal business purposes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProvide you with our services\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eBetter tailor our services to you depending on your geographical region\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eSafety purposes\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eConduct business with you or your employer\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProvide you with services\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOtherwise communicate with you\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eProvide basic functionality to the website\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eAllow user logins into the system\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eMaintain session information\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eEnhance access to the features of the website\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eUnderstand how users use this website\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eUnderstand how to target users with appropriate advertisements\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRate analysis\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}}]},{&#34;columnOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;columnName&#34;:&#34;Categories of recipients to whom we disclose personal information for a business purpose&#34;,&#34;rowDetails&#34;:[{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRegulatory authorities\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFinancial services entities\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService Providers\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRegulators\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFinancial services entities\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFinancial services entities\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRegulatory authorities\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eFinancial services entities\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRegulators\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eRegulators\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}},{&#34;rowOrder&#34;:&#34;&#34;,&#34;rowValue&#34;:&#34;\u003cul\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eService Providers and contractors\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n \u003cli\u003eOther third parties as required by law\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e&#34;,&#34;iconPlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imagePlacement&#34;:&#34;above&#34;,&#34;imageSize&#34;:&#34;regular&#34;,&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}}]}],&#34;externalizer&#34;:{&#34;log&#34;:{&#34;name&#34;:&#34;com.day.cq.commons.impl.ExternalizerImpl&#34;},&#34;domains&#34;:{&#34;preview&#34;:&#34;https://preview.pge.com&#34;,&#34;preview-corp&#34;:&#34;https://preview.corp.pge.com&#34;,&#34;author&#34;:&#34;https://author-p55603-e478970.adobeaemcloud.com&#34;,&#34;preview-pipeline&#34;:&#34;https://preview.pge.com&#34;,&#34;publish&#34;:&#34;https://www.pge.com&#34;,&#34;publish-corp&#34;:&#34;https://www.pgecorp.com&#34;,&#34;publish-pge&#34;:&#34;https://www.pge.com&#34;,&#34;local&#34;:&#34;https://www.pge.com&#34;,&#34;preview-pge&#34;:&#34;https://preview.pge.com&#34;,&#34;publish-pipeline&#34;:&#34;https://www.pge.com&#34;},&#34;assumeEncodedPath&#34;:false},&#34;envModel&#34;:{&#34;runMode&#34;:&#34;publish&#34;}}'></div>
